<h2 class="mt-14">Consent and purchaser suppression for Cross sell</h2>
<p>For cross sell, audit consent capture and purchase-event suppression before the first flow goes live — every app must record cross sell opt-ins you can evidence and halt promos at checkout. For cross sell, a promo arriving after a purchase, refund, or open support case burns trust faster than weak cross sell creative ever could.</p>
