<tr><td>No documented consent</td><td>Suppress cross sell marketing entirely until consent is documented</td><td>Without cross sell consent proof, marketing has no legal footing</td></tr>
<tr><td>Consented, never purchased</td><td>Cross Sell education and proof before any offer</td><td>First-touch cross sell codes create discount dependence</td></tr>
<tr><td>Active cart, no checkout</td><td>Context-rich cross sell nudge before any incentive</td><td>Cross Sell high-intent window deserves margin discipline</td></tr>
