<tr><td>Refund or return open</td><td>Freeze cross sell promos until refund or return closes</td><td>Service-active cross sell shoppers reject promos</td></tr>
<tr><td>Repeated non-engagement</td><td>Sunset cold cross sell contacts before complaints build</td><td>Shields cross sell sender reputation and inboxing</td></tr>
<tr><td>SMS consent present</td><td>Cap cross sell SMS cadence within legal quiet windows</td><td>Text grievances hit cross sell programs hardest</td></tr>
