<h2 class="mt-12">Margin, app costs, and pricing for Cross sell</h2>
<p>Judge cross sell on margin, not attribution. A durable cross sell program absorbs subscription, overages, SMS, capture, creative, agency, and discount costs and still pays. If cross sell tooling eats toward fifteen percent of attributed margin, reduce cross sell scope before optimizing flows.</p>
<p>Pricing changes frequently and varies by region, contact volume, and contract term, so check the official pricing pages of every shortlisted app and model an eighteen-month total that includes a peak season. Before banking on free for cross sell, check which free-tier limit — contacts, sends, branching, support — hits your cross sell plan earliest.</p>
